---
title: Local mirror · one pull of the change feed
---
flowchart TB
  poke(["`**Poke**
  Launch · own command · realtime insert
  Focus · network back · one-minute timer`"]):::people
  queue{{"`**One pull at a time**
  Pokes during a pull collapse into one follow-up`"}}:::gate
  ready{"`Copy ready and
  cursor at or behind the head?`"}:::gate
  boot["`**Bootstrap**
  Read the head cursor first
  Replace every account table, four at a time`"]:::local
  page["`**Read a feed page**
  manor_workspace_changes after the cursor`"]:::backend
  fold["`**Fold by key**
  Last change per row wins
  Deletes and purges remove by key`"]:::local
  skip{"`Local revision
  already current?`"}:::gate
  reread["`**Re-read by identity**
  Upsert returned rows
  Delete rows Postgres no longer returns`"]:::backend
  commit[("`**Commit page + cursor**
  One SQLite transaction`")]:::local
  publish(["`**Publish touched tables**
  Pages that show them reload from disk`"]):::app

  poke --> queue --> ready
  ready -->|no| boot --> page
  ready -->|yes| page
  page --> fold --> skip
  skip -->|yes| commit
  skip -->|no| reread --> commit
  commit --> publish
  commit async_1@-.->|more pages| page
